A Cargo subcommand that enables verification of Rust code as part of the normal Cargo workflow.

Usage: cargo verus <COMMAND>

Commands:
  new        Create a new Verus project
  fmt        Format Verus and Rust source files
  toolchain  Manage Verus toolchains
  verify     Verify the current crate with 'cargo build'
  focus      Verify only crate contents, without dependencies
  build      Verify and build the current crate with 'cargo build'
  check      Runs the 'cargo check' subcommand
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
